  "title": "Govt picks BSNL, MTNL assets worth ₹1,300 crore for monetisation",
  "summary": "The government has selected BSNL and MTNL to monetise their surplus public sector assets, aiming to address outstanding liabilities and unlock value from these assets.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The government allocated ₹1,300 crore to BSNL and MTNL for monetisation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The move is part of the government's broader strategy to manage public sector liabilities and unlock assets for economic development.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The funds are expected to generate additional revenue and improve the efficiency of state-owned telecom companies.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
